    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-roguelite you <strong>play as the spirit of a fisherman</strong> named Theo, who died at sea and desires to go back to his old life on the other side of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you are <strong>stuck in the Drift</strong>, the land between the living and the dead, you will encounter other restless spirits who've been dwelling and manifesting into abominations, <strong>preventing you from reaching your home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your harpoon, you must <strong>fight your way from island to island</strong> with your fishing boat to <strong>collect resources</strong>, so you can <strong>craft upgrades according to your play style</strong> and be able to defeat the restless abominations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-roguelite you <strong>play as the spirit of a fisherman</strong> named Theo, who died at sea and desires to go back to his old life on the other side of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you are <strong>stuck in the Drift</strong>, the land between the living and the dead, you will encounter other restless spirits who've been dwelling and manifesting into abominations, <strong>preventing you from reaching your home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your harpoon, you must <strong>fight your way from island to island</strong> with your fishing boat to <strong>collect resources</strong>, so you can <strong>craft upgrades according to your play style</strong> and be able to defeat the restless abominations.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fight your way home through the Drift as the spirit of a fisherman in this action roguelite with a taste of souls-like methodical combat.",
